Package: panna
Title: Player Rating System for Football Using RAPM, SPM, and EPV Methods
Version: 0.3.32
Authors@R:
    person("Pete", "Owen", , "pete.owen1@hotmail.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Implements player ratings for football (soccer) from 'Opta'
    event and tracking-adjacent data. Combines Regularized Adjusted
    Plus-Minus ('RAPM') with Statistical Plus-Minus ('SPM') as a Bayesian
    prior, analysing time segments with constant lineups ('splints') to
    estimate each player's contribution to expected goals ('xG')
    differential. Action-level Expected Possession Value ('EPV') and win
    probability added ('WPA') models support decay-weighted rating
    composites (EPR, PSR, Panna, Piero) plus match prediction and
    tournament simulation.
